# Graphify: only the graph, its report and the HTML view are shared; the rest
# (caches, interpreter and scan paths of one machine) stays local.
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/graph.json
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
!graphify-out/graph.html
